# MWX-ISP — FRONTIER RESEARCH × ULTRA-DEEP AUDIT × 50 ISSUE PORTFOLIO
**Master edition V3 | 27 Oktober 2026 | Research & planning ONLY | 25 Engineering + 25 Frontier**

> **Important:** Source code, GitHub Issues, and branch settings were inspected read-only through the connected GitHub tools; external research checked using public sources. **No source edits, branches, GitHub Issues, production probes or system tests were executed by this audit.** All scores are structured expert judgements, not measured business ROI. The uploaded V3 prompt and `AGENT.md` are the planning requirements.

